        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.southcarolinagenealogy.org/counties/york/towns/newport"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Many places in the Newport area reflect the history of Scots-Irish backcountry settlement and Revolutionary War geography.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.southcarolinagenealogy.org/counties/york/towns/newport"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Local history in Newport often reflects the development of textile-mill villages, which frequently featured their own distinct chapels.",
